WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From a low lunge, walk the front foot out toward the edge of the mat.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Lower onto the forearms (or a block) inside the front foot.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Keep the back leg active, knee lifted or lowered.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Breathe and stay; switch sides.
